    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player clicker game that has you picking berries from a berry bush. Those berries can be processed and sold for coin using a cannon to ship your product. Upgrade your berry bush enough times to get some garden gnomes to employ. There's no limit to how much your berry bush can be upgraded.</p>",
